TI  - The mycobiome as integral part of the gut microbiome: crucial role of symbiotic fungi in health and disease
AN  - 39676474
DO  - 10.1080/19490976.2024.2440111
IS  - 1
VL  - 16
DA  - 2024/Jan-Dec
PY  - 2024
JO  - Gut microbes
J2  - Gut Microbes
